<article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Direct expansion: 
    <p>
      <div class="equation">
  \begin{align*}  (a+b)^2 & = (a+b)(a+b) \\ & = a^2 + ab + ba + b^2 \\ & = a^2 + 2ab + b^2. \qedhere \end{align*}
</div>
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>